Package: bakeR
Type: Package
Title: Call the Gateaux API from R
Version: 0.3.0
Author: Philipp Neubauer
Maintainer: Philipp Neubauer <philipp@dragonfly.co.nz>
Description: Launch, list, wait for and cancel Gateaux jobs from R, and fetch their logs and outputs. Talks to the v2 API by default; the legacy API can be selected with api = "v1".
License: DF
Imports: httr, jsonlite, readr (>= 2.0.0), magrittr, dplyr, tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
